 <title>PMP CLASS SESSION 07 Mai au 04 Septembre 2026</title>
 <link>https://www.esmt.sn/en/evenements/pmp-class-session-07-mai-au-04-septembre-2026</link>
 <description>&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-image-event field-type-image field-label-hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;img typeof=&quot;foaf:Image&quot; class=&quot;img-responsive&quot; src=&quot;https://www.esmt.sn/sites/default/files/pmp-sw-la-formation-contiinue-2026.jpg&quot; width=&quot;310&quot; height=&quot;145&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-description field-type-text-long field-label-above&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-label&quot;&gt;Description:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; direction: ltr; color: rgb(59, 32, 77) !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:20px&quot;&gt;Le PMP® est aujourd’hui reconnu comme la référence mondiale en management de projets, un véritable passeport vers de nouvelles opportunités professionnelles et un gage de crédibilité auprès des employeurs et partenaires.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; direction: ltr; color: rgb(59, 32, 77) !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;À l’ESMT, nous mettons un point d’honneur à vous offrir :&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border: 0px; font: inherit; margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit; direction: ltr;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;Des formateurs certifiés et expérimentés, experts dans l’accompagnement des professionnels vers la réussite de l’examen PMP®.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border: 0px; font: inherit; margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit; direction: ltr;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;Un encadrement personnalisé tout au long de votre parcours, afin de maximiser vos chances de réussite.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border: 0px; font: inherit; margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit; direction: ltr;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px&quot;&gt;Un environnement d’apprentissage stimulant et interactif, qui allie rigueur académique et mise en pratique des concepts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; margin: 1em 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; direction: ltr; color: rgb(59, 32, 77) !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.esmt.sn/sites/default/files/fiche_technique_pmp_class_7_mai_au_4_sept_26_0.pdf&quot;&gt;La fiche technique du programme. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-date field-type-datetime field-label-above&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-label&quot;&gt;Date:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;date-display-single&quot; property=&quot;dc:date&quot; datatype=&quot;xsd:dateTime&quot; content=&quot;2026-05-07T00:00:00+00:00&quot;&gt;07-05-2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field field-name-field-fichiers-s- field-type-file field-label-above&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-label&quot;&gt;Fichiers(s):&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field-item even&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;file&quot;&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;file-icon&quot; alt=&quot;PDF icon&quot; title=&quot;application/pdf&quot; src=&quot;/modules/file/icons/application-pdf.png&quot; /&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.esmt.sn/sites/default/files/fiche_technique_pmp_class_7_mai_au_4_sept_26.pdf&quot; type=&quot;application/pdf; length=463328&quot;&gt;fiche_technique_pmp_class_7_mai_au_4_sept_26.pdf&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;social-share clearfix&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;share-label&quot;&gt;Shar on: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://facebook.com/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.esmt.sn%2Fen%2Fevenements%2Fpmp-class-session-07-mai-au-04-septembre-2026&amp;amp;t=PMP%20CLASS%20SESSION%2007%20Mai%20au%2004%20Septembre%202026&quot; class=&quot;social-share-facebook&quot; title=&quot;Facebook&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://plus.google.com/share?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.esmt.sn%2Fen%2Fevenements%2Fpmp-class-session-07-mai-au-04-septembre-2026&quot; class=&quot;social-share-googleplus&quot; title=&quot;Google Plus&quot;&gt;Google Plus&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.esmt.sn%2Fen%2Fev